# TeamPop pilot reverse proxy — Xfused (goxfused.com)
#
# Replace api.teampop.<TLD> with the real subdomain (must match the DNS
# A-record and the SEARCH_API_URL/PUBLIC_SEARCH_API_URL/WIDGET_SCRIPT_URL/
# IMAGE_SERVER_URL baked at onboarding time).
#
# Single upstream = the proven topology: everything goes to onboarding-service
# (:8005), which serves /widget + /images and proxies /search + /product-details
# to search-service (:8006) internally. This mirrors the working single-tunnel
# dev setup, so it's the least-surprise choice for launch.
#
# OPTIONAL post-pilot optimization (isolates the hot search path from the
# heavier onboarding process, one less hop) — NOT enabled for launch:
#   handle /search*          { reverse_proxy localhost:8006 }
#   handle /product-details* { reverse_proxy localhost:8006 }
#   handle                   { reverse_proxy localhost:8005 }

